WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.257
Unit two. Personal Hygiene!

2
00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:07.947
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.997 --> 00:00:11.342
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:15.172
Today we learn about Personal Hygiene. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.500
Shower. Say it with me. Shower!

6
00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:26.671
Shampoo. Say it with me. Shampoo!

7
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:33.764
Nails. Say it with me. Nails!

8
00:00:37.268 --> 00:00:40.734
Deodorant. Say it with me. Deodorant!

9
00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:48.300
Clean clothes. Say it with me. Clean clothes!

10
00:00:51.796 --> 00:00:55.313
Routine. Say it with me. Routine!

11
00:00:58.814 --> 00:01:02.147
Fresh. Say it with me. Fresh!

12
00:01:05.644 --> 00:01:08.977
Habit. Say it with me. Habit!

13
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:21.866
Taking a shower and washing my hair with shampoo keeps me fresh. I trim my nails and wear clean clothes every day. A good hygiene routine becomes a healthy habit.

14
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.115
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.544 --> 00:01:29.761
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.811 --> 00:01:30.961
Nails!

17
00:01:31.974 --> 00:01:37.284
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:38.484
Fresh!

19
00:01:39.374 --> 00:01:45.763
Did you know? Fingernails grow faster than toenails, and both keep growing your whole life!

20
00:01:45.813 --> 00:01:47.911
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.703 --> 00:01:56.553
Think and answer. What is part of your daily hygiene routine?

22
00:01:56.603 --> 00:01:57.753
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:03.971
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.021 --> 00:02:06.609
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

